  "title": "8 iPhone tricks I learned living in New York",
  "caption": "Living in NYC? Turn these iPhone features on 🏙️\nSwipe through before your stop.\n\nBonus iPhone hacks:\n• Swipe on the Calculator display to delete the last digit\n• Lock any app with Face ID by holding its icon\n• Turn on a camera grid and level for straighter photos\n• Hold the space bar to turn your keyboard into a trackpad\n• Recover deleted photos from Recently Deleted\n\nHow to get Cardivo 📲\n1. Open the App Store\n2. Type \"Cardivo\" in the search bar\n3. Tap Get and open the app\n\n#cardivo #nycliving #iphonetricks #nyctiktok #iphonehacks #lifehacks #hiddenfeatures #iphonetips #newyorkcity",
